/// BVA exec/board full-scope read role (Sprint 15 · T6). C-suite members
/// (CEO/CFO/CIO/COO/CTO) see every hospital in the BVA data product. BVA Gold is
/// synthetic, non-PHI Azure-consumption + value data, so no PHI predicate is
/// needed here; exec segregation is by report page, not by RLS. Assignable to
/// HCC.ExecBoard in SIT and PROD (design spec §8).
role BvaExecFull
	modelPermission: read
